>**Increase nation's Prosperity.**
=2 Walkthrough
+ Head to (K-5) in {z:East Ronfaure (S)}. Click on the ??? you find there to spawn three {m:Goblin Picaroons|Goblin Picaroon}.
+ After killing the NMs, check the ??? again to complete the quest. Make sure to examine the ??? or you will fail when you return.

=2 Notes
* The {m:Goblin Picaroons|Goblin Picaroon} spawn as {p:WAR|Warrior},{p:RNG|Ranger} and {p:RDM|Red Mage} with no difference in name, they each use normal armor for that job type.
* If one or more of them go unclaimed after 1 minute, they will despawn resulting in an automatic failure.
* The goblins will {p:Rage|Category:Jug Pets} after a certain amount of time passes since they were spawned (10-15 minutes __(verification needed)__) so be sure to bring enough damage-dealers to kill them quickly.
* Estimated to have 10,000 HP. Asuran fists at start of fight dealt 999 damage and removed 10% HP from RDM goblin.
* Killable by: __(see {p:testimonials|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Talk:Delta_Strike_III_(San_d'Oria)})__
* There are lots of local goblins in the area, Kill them as needed or pull the NM's away from link range.
* Others assisting with the fight may also check the ??? after the win for an exp/limit reward regardless of whether they have the mission active. However. if they do not have the mission active, they will not receive Allied Notes or credit for the victory.

=2 Game Description
\**Client:** {n:Rasdinice} ({z:Southern San d'Oria (S)})
